title: "ABF Data Analysis Code: interactive contractility analysis of living myocardial slice recordings"
abstract: "Python tool for extracting per-twitch contractile parameters (active and passive force, amplitude, time to peak, time to 50% and 90% relaxation, and decay time constant tau) from Axon Binary Format (.abf) force recordings of living myocardial slices."
type: software
